87
00:03:42,060 --> 00:03:44,220
That way, I don't feel there's a gap between us.

88
00:03:44,660 --> 00:03:46,500
It's not really about money or status.

89
00:03:46,500 --> 00:03:47,140
Or anything like that.

90
00:03:47,140 --> 00:03:48,580
It's just a kind of

91
