129
00:04:53,380 --> 00:04:54,340
It really is hard.

130
00:05:12,980 --> 00:05:15,060
Went out to get some air.

131
00:05:17,580 --> 00:05:19,380
Bro, when it comes to relationships,

132
00:05:19,380 --> 00:05:20,820
what are you most afraid of?

133
00:05:22,900 --> 00:05:24,180
What scares you the most?

134
00:05:24,660 --> 00:05:25,780
Or let me put it this way,

135
00:05:25,780 --> 00:05:26,580
