159
00:06:16,900 --> 00:06:19,060
I'm really afraid of that feeling of insecurity.

160
00:06:19,060 --> 00:06:20,380
By insecurity, I mean

161
00:06:20,940 --> 00:06:23,060
it's like his relationship with you

162
